  "description_short": "Farm-fresh fare at Redberry Farm in Blanco, where rustic charm meets local produce and community.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Redberry Farm along Geelhoutboom Road in Blanco, Bounty Eatery offers a genuine farm-to-table experience just outside George. The setting is relaxed and rustic, with tables scattered under shade trees and views across working farmland. It's the kind of place where you can taste the difference that fresh, local ingredients make.\n\nThe menu celebrates seasonal produce from the surrounding farms, with hearty breakfasts, wholesome lunches, and home-baked goods that draw locals and visitors alike. Expect generous portions, honest flavours, and a warm welcome from staff who clearly love what they do. The coffee is excellent, the atmosphere unhurried, and there's often something happening—whether it's a weekend market or live music.\n\nWhether you're stopping by after a morning hike, meeting friends for a lazy weekend lunch, or stocking up at the farm stall, Bounty Eatery captures the best of Garden Route country living. It's a spot that feels like a local secret, even though word is definitely out.",
